.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2023-FAB-IN Fabrikam Service Partners.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Service Partner Agreement  \\\\r\\\\n_Fabrikam Service Partners \\\\u2014 SPA-2023-FAB-IN_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Agreement reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nSPA-2023-FAB-IN\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nFabrikam Service Partners\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner code**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nD-IN-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Territory**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Settlement currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nINR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 1. Appointment\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial appoints Fabrikam Service Partners as an authorised service partner for the territory named above, to carry out warranty repairs on Contoso Industrial equipment and to submit claims in accordance with the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 2. Claim submission\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA claim is submitted within 30 days of the date of repair, giving the part number actually fitted and attaching the inspection report where one was raised. Contoso Industrial adjudicates the claim from the claim-system record, taking running hours from the latest reading held at or before the date of repair. An inspection report matters where an exclusion depends on it; a missing report does not of itself hold a claim.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 3. Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nLabour is reimbursed at the flat-rate allowance published for the operation code, at the regional labour rate in force on the date of repair, in accordance with clause 4.1 of the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 6. Parts and handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nParts are reimbursed at the published list price for the territory, for the part actually fitted.  \\\\r\\\\nNo handling uplift is payable under this agreement. Parts are reimbursed at list price without addition.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 9. Term\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis agreement runs for three years from execution and renews annually unless either party gives ninety days\\\\u0027 written notice.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.83806473}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/06-ClaimEvidence/C-2026-04186 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01362.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022C-2026-04186 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01362\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022C-2026-04186 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01362.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/06-ClaimEvidence/C-2026-04186 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01362.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Field Inspection Report  \\\\r\\\\n_Claim C-2026-04186_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Claim reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nC-2026-04186\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Serial number**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCIE-4000-CH-01362\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Product**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Service partner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nFabrikam Service Partners\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Date of repair**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2026-06-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Operation code**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHYD-PUMP-RR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Running hours at repair**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n3,000\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Findings\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic pump seized under load. Drive coupling intact. No external impact damage. Pump removed and replaced.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Fluid analysis\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic fluid sample returned ISO 4406 class 22/20/17, above the acceptable limit. Particulate examined under magnification and found to be silica consistent with ingress through an unsealed reservoir cap left open during site top-up. The filter housing was examined and found intact. The contamination is not attributable to the filter housing defect.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Parts fitted\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Part number**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Description**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Quantity**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nP-44120-A\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic pump assembly, rev A\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\n5.5 hours claimed against operation HYD-PUMP-RR.  \\\\r\\\\n_Inspected by: Sunil Bhat, Field Engineer, Fabrikam Service Partners_\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.71465504}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2024-NWD-IN Northwind Field Services.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2024-NWD-IN Northwind Field Services\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2024-NWD-IN Northwind Field Services.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.co