362\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022C-2026-04186 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01362.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/06-ClaimEvidence/C-2026-04186 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01362.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Field Inspection Report  \\\\r\\\\n_Claim C-2026-04186_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Claim reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nC-2026-04186\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Serial number**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCIE-4000-CH-01362\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Product**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Service partner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nFabrikam Service Partners\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Date of repair**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2026-06-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Operation code**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHYD-PUMP-RR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Running hours at repair**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n3,000\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Findings\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic pump seized under load. Drive coupling intact. No external impact damage. Pump removed and replaced.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Fluid analysis\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic fluid sample returned ISO 4406 class 22/20/17, above the acceptable limit. Particulate examined under magnification and found to be silica consistent with ingress through an unsealed reservoir cap left open during site top-up. The filter housing was examined and found intact. The contamination is not attributable to the filter housing defect.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Parts fitted\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Part number**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Description**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Quantity**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nP-44120-A\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic pump assembly, rev A\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\n5.5 hours claimed against operation HYD-PUMP-RR.  \\\\r\\\\n_Inspected by: Sunil Bhat, Field Engineer, Fabrikam Service Partners_\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.7188543}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\u003Cslide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWarranty Review \\\\u2014 FY26 Q2\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial \\\\u00B7 Warranty Operations \\\\u00B7 published 14 October 2025\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EHeadlines\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Warranty cost at 2.8% of revenue, down 0.3 points on FY25 Q4\\\\r\\\\n- Claim volume up 11% year on year, driven by the 4000-series installed base\\\\r\\\\n- Average settlement time 8.4 working days against a 10-day target\\\\r\\\\n- India remains the largest region by claim volume\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECoverage at a glance\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Standard coverage: 24 months from commissioning, or 6,000 running hours\\\\r\\\\n- Applies across all product families and all regions\\\\r\\\\n- Labour reimbursed at flat-rate allowance\\\\r\\\\n- Parts reimbursed at territory list price\\\\r\\\\n- Goodwill available at manager discretion for near-miss cases\\\\r\\\\n- TRAP 6. This slide is the stale summary. \\\\u0027Applies across all product families and all regions\\\\u0027 was never true of India (18 months under ADD-IN-2.1) and is wrong for any asset covered by TSB-C-0051 or TSB-P-0112. \\\\u0027Goodwill at manager discretion\\\\u0027 contradicts policy 7.1, which requires recorded authority at tier. A model that trusts this deck over the policy fails the Evidence grounding rubric.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWarranty cost by product family (INR lakh)\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cchart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003CsourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY25 Q3\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY25 Q4\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q1\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q2\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E4000-series chiller\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E182\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E174\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E196\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E211\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E2200-series compressor\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E96\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E101\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E94\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E88\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/chart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_5\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003ETop failure modes \\\\u2014 4000-series\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Component**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Claims**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Share**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Trend**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic circuit\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n214\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n38%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nRising\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCompressor\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n147\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n26%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nStable\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nControl system\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n88\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n16%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nFalling\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nStructural / cooling\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n61\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n11%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nStable\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nOther\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n52\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n9%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nStable\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_5\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_6\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EActions\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Engineering to review hydraulic circuit failure rate on the 4000-series\\\\r\\\\n- Bulletin under consideration for affected serial ranges\\\\r\\\\n- Partner documentation quality to be raised at the Q3 partner forum\\\\r\\\\n- Rate card review ahead of FY26 close\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_6\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.76339644}]}]}\"}]", "LatencyMs": 5311}, {"ToolCallId": "call_svEG6LcNpxGcxfZOOmJKDZeH", "Title": "34d14__get_running_hours", "Status": "Completed", "Inputs": [{"Name": "serial", "Value": "CIE-2200-AC-00320"}, {"Name": "as_of", "Value": "2026-04-22"}], "Output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\u0022found\\u0022: true,\\n  \\u0022serial\\u0022: \\u0022CIE-2200-AC-00320\\u0022,\\n  \\u0022as_of_date\\u0022: \\u00222026-04-02\\u0022,\\n  \\u0022running_hours\\u0022: 2750\\n}\"}]", "LatencyMs": 3494}, {"ToolCallId": "call_l7Z5xHo2MMMvaqLBbQNkQjJu", "Title": "34d14__get_dealer", "Status": "Completed", "Inputs": [{"Name": "dealer_id", "Value": "D-IN-01"}], "Output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\n  \\u0022found\\u0022: true,\\n  \\u0022dealer_id\\u0022: \\u0022D-IN-01\\u0022,\\n  \\u0022name\\u0022: \\u0022Fabrikam Service Partners\\u0022,\\n  \\u0022region\\u0022: \\u0022India\\u0022,\\n  \\u0022currency\\u0022: \\u0022INR\\u0022,\\n  \\u0022uplift_pct\\u0022: 0.0,\\n  \\u0022agreement_ref\\u0022: \\u0022SPA-2023-FAB-IN\\u0022,\\n  \\u0022submission_sla_days\\u0022: 30,\\n  \\u0022note\\u0022: \\u0022uplift_pct is payable on parts only, and only where the partner\\u0027s Service Partner Agreement grants it (policy 4.3).\\u0022\\n}\"}]", "LatencyMs": 3517}, {"ToolCallId": "call_BJYq0RZOyXCiKGVgDxtZD6yZ", "Title": "m365__search_enterprise_files", "Status": "Completed", "Inputs": [{"Name": "searchQuery", "Value": "Global Warranty Policy Contoso Industrial"}, {"Name": "from", "Value": "0"}, {"Name": "size", "Value": "10"}], "Output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\u0022FileRetrievalDetails\\u0022:[{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 4.2 \\\\u2014 effective 2025-04-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Version**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4.2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2025-04-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Document owner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nWarranty Operations\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Applies to**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nAll products, all regions, all authorised service partners\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Supersedes**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.1 (effective 1 April 2024)\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Purpose\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis policy sets out the warranty Contoso Industrial provides on equipment it manufactures, the basis on which a claim from an authorised service partner is adjudicated, and the amounts payable. It applies to every claim submitted through the service claim system.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 1. Interpretation\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 1.4  Precedence between instruments\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nWhere two or more instruments address the same asset, the order of precedence is: (a) a Technical Service Bulletin that names the serial range of the asset; (b) the Regional Addendum for the region in which the asset is installed; (c) this policy. A Bulletin that has been superseded has no effect, whether or not it remains published. Where the Bulletin document and the service system applicability index disagree, the Bulletin document governs; the index is maintained for reporting and is informational only.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 2. Coverage\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 2.1  Standard coverage period\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nUnless extended or varied by an instrument of higher precedence, an asset is covered for twenty-four (24) months from the date of commissioning, or six thousand (6,000) running hours, whichever occurs first.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 2.3  Assets with no commissioning record\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nWhere the commissioning record for an asset is absent from the asset registry, coverage cannot be determined. The claim is to be held and the commissioning certificate requested from the installing partner. The date of despatch or the date of installation must not be substituted for the date of commissioning.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 4. Amounts payable\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 4.1  Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nLabour is payable at the flat-rate allowance published for the operation code in the current Flat Rate Labour schedule, or at the hours actually claimed, whichever is the lesser. The rate applied is the regional labour rate in force on the date of repair.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 4.2  Parts\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nParts are payable at the published list price for the region, for the part actually fitted. Where a part has been superseded, the price of the superseding part applies.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 4.3  Handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA handling uplift on parts is payable only where the partner\\\\u0027s Service Partner Agreement expressly grants one, at the percentage stated in that agreement.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 5. Exclusions\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.1  Exclusion - misuse and overload\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nDamage arising from operation outside the published duty envelope, including sustained overload, is excluded.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.2  Exclusion - fluid contamination\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nDamage arising from hydraulic fluid contamination above ISO 4406 class 18/16/13 is excluded, save where a Technical Service Bulletin provides otherwise.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.3  Exclusion - unauthorised modification\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nDamage arising from modification not authorised in writing by Contoso Industrial is excluded.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.4  Exclusion - consumables\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nFilters, fluids, belts, seals and other consumables are excluded when replaced as scheduled maintenance. Scheduled maintenance is not claimable under warranty and has no warranty operation code, so a consumable claimed under a warranty repair operation code is treated as a corrective repair and is covered, unless an inspection report records the replacement as routine.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 6. Repair warranty\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 6.1  Repair warranty\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA component replaced under warranty carries a further ninety (90) days of coverage from the date the repair was completed. A claim arising within that period is adjudicated under this clause and carries funding code RW, whether or not the underlying asset remains within its coverage period.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 7. Goodwill and authority\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 7.1  Goodwill authority\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nAn amount payable outside coverage may be authorised as goodwill only by a person holding the tier of authority set out in the Goodwill and Authority Matrix for that amount, and only where the authority is recorded in the claim system. An approval given in conversation, in a channel message, or by telephone does not constitute authority for the purposes of this clause.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.87253815},{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\r\\\\n## Annexes\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThe Flat Rate Labour schedule, the regional labour rate schedule and the parts price list are maintained separately and published in the Warranty Operations library. The Goodwill and Authority Matrix referred to at clause 7.1 is published alongside this policy.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.73796767}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/03-RateCards/Flat-Rate-Labour-FY26.xlsx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022Flat-Rate-Labour-FY26\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022openpyxl;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022Flat-Rate-Labour-FY26.xlsx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/03-RateCards/Flat-Rate-Labour-FY26.xlsx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\u003Csheet_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Flat Rate Labour\\\\r\\\\nFlat Rate Labour Schedule \\\\u2014 FY26\\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial \\\\u00B7 Warranty Operations \\\\u00B7 effective 1 April 2026 \\\\u00B7 hours payable per operation, per policy clause 4.1\\\\r\\\\nOperation code\\\\r\\\\nDescription\\\\r\\\\nProduct family\\\\r\\\\nComponent\\\\r\\\\nFlat-rate hours\\\\r\\\\nHYD-PUMP-RR\\\\r\\\\nHydraulic pump - remove and replace\\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\nhydraulic\\\\r\\\\n5.5\\\\r\\\\nFILT-HSG-RR\\\\r\\\\nFilter housing - remove and replace\\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\nhydraulic\\\\r\\\\n2.5\\\\r\\\\nCOMP-RR\\\\r\\\\nCompressor module - remove and replace\\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\ncompressor\\\\r\\\\n9\\\\r\\\\nCTRL-BD-RR\\\\r\\\\nControl board - replace\\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\ncontrols\\\\r\\\\n1.5\\\\r\\\\nCOND-FAN-RR\\\\r\\\\nCondenser fan assembly - replace\\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\nstructure\\\\r\\\\n3.5\\\\r\\\\nVALVE-PLT-RR\\\\r\\\\nValve plate kit - replace\\\\r\\\\n2200-series air compressor\\\\r\\\\nvalve plate\\\\r\\\\n4\\\\r\\\\nMOTOR-RR\\\\r\\\\nDrive motor - replace\\\\r\\\\n2200-series air compressor\\\\r\\\\ndrive\\\\r\\\\n7.5\\\\r\\\\nBEARING-RR\\\\r\\\\nMain bearing set - replace\\\\r\\\\n2200-series air compressor\\\\r\\\\ndrive\\\\r\\\\n6\\\\r\\\\nSEAL-KIT-RR\\\\r\\\\nSeal kit - replace\\\\r\\\\n2200-series air compressor\\\\r\\\\nseals\\\\r\\\\n3\\\\r\\\\nDIAG-FIELD\\\\r\\\\nField diagnostic visit\\\\r\\\\nany\\\\r\\\\nany\\\\r\\\\n2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sheet_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Csheet_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Notes\\\\r\\\\nFlat Rate Labour Schedule \\\\u2014 FY26\\\\r\\\\nLabour is payable at the flat-rate allowance for the operation code, or at the\\\\r\\\\nhours actually claimed, whichever is the lesser (Global Warranty Policy, 4.1).\\\\r\\\\nHours above the flat-rate allowance are not payable and are reported to the\\\\r\\\\npartner as a variance on the adjudication.\\\\r\\\\nThe rate applied to these hours is the regional labour rate in force on the\\\\r\\\\ndate of repair. See Labour-Rates-By-Region-FY26.xlsx.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sheet_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.73692137}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Regional Addendum - India  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 2.1 \\\\u2014 effective 2025-04-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-IN-2.1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Region**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nINR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2025-04-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Read with**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Scope\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis addendum varies the Global Warranty Policy for equipment installed in India. Where this addendum is silent, the Global Warranty Policy applies without variation. Where a Technical Service Bulletin names the serial range of an asset, clause 1.4 of the Global Warranty Policy governs the order of precedence.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A1  Varied coverage period\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nFor assets installed in India, the standard coverage period at clause 2.1 of the Global Warranty Policy is varied to eighteen (18) months from the date of commissioning, or five thousand (5,000) running hours, whichever occurs first.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A3  Coastal and monsoon exclusion\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nCorrosion damage at a coastal installation arising between 1 June and 30 September is excluded, save where a Technical Service Bulletin provides otherwise.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Summary of varied terms\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Term**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Global policy**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**India**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCoverage period\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n18 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nRunning-hours limit\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n5,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.81749743}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Regional Addendum - APAC  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 1.1 \\\\u2014 effective 2025-04-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-AP-1.1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Region**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nAPAC\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\