E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nRunning-hours limit\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.8307031}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Regional Addendum - EMEA  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 1.3 \\\\u2014 effective 2024-10-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-EM-1.3\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Region**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEMEA\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEUR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2024-10-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Read with**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Scope\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis addendum varies the Global Warranty Policy for equipment installed in EMEA. Where this addendum is silent, the Global Warranty Policy applies without variation. Where a Technical Service Bulletin names the serial range of an asset, clause 1.4 of the Global Warranty Policy governs the order of precedence.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A1  Coverage period\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThe standard coverage period at clause 2.1 of the Global Warranty Policy applies without variation.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A2  Currency\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nAmounts are payable in euro at the published EMEA rates.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Summary of varied terms\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Term**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Global policy**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**EMEA**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCoverage period\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nRunning-hours limit\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.82108283}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2023-FAB-IN Fabrikam Service Partners.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2023-FAB-IN Fabrikam Service Partners\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2023-FAB-IN Fabrikam Service Partners.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2023-FAB-IN Fabrikam Service Partners.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Service Partner Agreement  \\\\r\\\\n_Fabrikam Service Partners \\\\u2014 SPA-2023-FAB-IN_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Agreement reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nSPA-2023-FAB-IN\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nFabrikam Service Partners\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner code**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nD-IN-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Territory**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Settlement currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nINR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 1. Appointment\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial appoints Fabrikam Service Partners as an authorised service partner for the territory named above, to carry out warranty repairs on Contoso Industrial equipment and to submit claims in accordance with the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 2. Claim submission\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA claim is submitted within 30 days of the date of repair, giving the part number actually fitted and attaching the inspection report where one was raised. Contoso Industrial adjudicates the claim from the claim-system record, taking running hours from the latest reading held at or before the date of repair. An inspection report matters where an exclusion depends on it; a missing report does not of itself hold a claim.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 3. Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nLabour is reimbursed at the flat-rate allowance published for the operation code, at the regional labour rate in force on the date of repair, in accordance with clause 4.1 of the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 6. Parts and handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nParts are reimbursed at the published list price for the territory, for the part actually fitted.  \\\\r\\\\nNo handling uplift is payable under this agreement. Parts are reimbursed at list price without addition.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 9. Term\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis agreement runs for three years from execution and renews annually unless either party gives ninety days\\\\u0027 written notice.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.82593304}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2024-NWD-IN Northwind Field Services.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2024-NWD-IN Northwind Field Services\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2024-NWD-IN Northwind Field Services.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2024-NWD-IN Northwind Field Services.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Service Partner Agreement  \\\\r\\\\n_Northwind Field Services \\\\u2014 SPA-2024-NWD-IN_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Agreement reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nSPA-2024-NWD-IN\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nNorthwind Field Services\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner code**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nD-IN-02\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Territory**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Settlement currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nINR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 1. Appointment\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial appoints Northwind Field Services as an authorised service partner for the territory named above, to carry out warranty repairs on Contoso Industrial equipment and to submit claims in accordance with the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 2. Claim submission\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA claim is submitted within 30 days of the date of repair, giving the part number actually fitted and attaching the inspection report where one was raised. Contoso Industrial adjudicates the claim from the claim-system record, taking running hours from the latest reading held at or before the date of repair. An inspection report matters where an exclusion depends on it; a missing report does not of itself hold a claim.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 3. Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nLabour is reimbursed at the flat-rate allowance published for the operation code, at the regional labour rate in force on the date of repair, in accordance with clause 4.1 of the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 6. Parts and handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nParts are reimbursed at the published list price for the territory, for the part actually fitted.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 6.2 Handling uplift\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\n**A handling uplift of 5.0% of the reimbursed parts value is payable to Northwind Field Services in addition to the parts value. The uplift is calculated on parts only and does not apply to labour.**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 9. Term\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis agreement runs for three years from execution and renews annually unless either party gives ninety days\\\\u0027 written notice.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.82869995}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2022-TWD-EM Tailwind Equipment Services.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2022-TWD-EM Tailwind Equipment Services\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022SPA-2022-TWD-EM Tailwind Equipment Services.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/04-PartnerAgreements/SPA-2022-TWD-EM Tailwind Equipment Services.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Service Partner Agreement  \\\\r\\\\n_Tailwind Equipment Services \\\\u2014 SPA-2022-TWD-EM_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Agreement reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nSPA-2022-TWD-EM\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTailwind Equipment Services\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Partner code**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nD-EM-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Territory**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEMEA\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Settlement currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEUR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 1. Appointment\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial appoints Tailwind Equipment Services as an authorised service partner for the territory named above, to carry out warranty repairs on Contoso Industrial equipment and to submit claims in accordance with the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 2. Claim submission\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA claim is submitted within 45 days of the date of repair, giving the part number actually fitted and attaching the inspection report where one was raised. Contoso Industrial adjudicates the claim from the claim-system record, taking running hours from the latest reading held at or before the date of repair. An inspection report matters where an exclusion depends on it; a missing report does not of itself hold a claim.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 3. Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nLabour is reimbursed at the flat-rate allowance published for the operation code, at the regional labour rate in force on the date of repair, in accordance with clause 4.1 of the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 6. Parts and handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nParts are reimbursed at the published list price for the territory, for the part actually fitted.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 6.2 Handling uplift\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\n**A handling uplift of 2.5% of the reimbursed parts value is payable to Tailwind Equipment Services in addition to the parts value. The uplift is calculated on parts only and does not apply to labour.**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 9. Term\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis agreement runs for three years from execution and renews annually unless either party gives ninety days\\\\u0027 written notice.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.82261044}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\u003Cslide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWarranty Review \\\\u2014 FY26 Q3\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial \\\\u00B7 Warranty Operations \\\\u00B7 published 16 April 2026\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EHeadlines\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Warranty cost at 3.4% of revenue, up 0.6 points \\\\u2014 driven by bulletin activity\\\\r\\\\n- TSB-C-0051 extended 4000-series hydraulic and compressor coverage in January\\\\r\\\\n- TSB-P-0112 superseded TSB-P-0107 in February, narrowing the covered range\\\\r\\\\n- FY26 labour rates took effect 1 April 2026\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECoverage position by instrument\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Instrument**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Applies to**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Period**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Notes**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nAll, unless varied\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 mo / 6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nGlobal baseline\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-IN-2.1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia installations\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n18 mo / 5,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nShorter than global\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-EM-1.3\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEMEA installations\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 mo / 6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nNo variation\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-C-0051\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4000-CH 01200-01850\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n36 mo / 8,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic \\\\u002B compressor\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-P-0112\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2200-AC 00400-00750\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n30 mo / 7,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nSupersedes 0107\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-C-0043\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4000-CH all serials\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nNo change\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nReverses 5.2 exclusion\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EPrecedence \\\\u2014 a reminder for adjudicators\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- A bulletin naming the serial range takes precedence over the regional addendum\\\\r\\\\n- The regional addendum takes precedence over the global policy\\\\r\\\\n- A superseded bulletin has no effect, whether or not it is still published\\\\r\\\\n- Where the claim system index and a bulletin disagree, the bulletin governs\\\\r\\\\n- Policy clause 1.4\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_5\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EClaims by funding code\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cchart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003CsourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q1\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q2\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q3\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EStandard\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E412\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E388\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E301\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EBulletin\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E0\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E12\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E168\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003ERepair warranty\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E31\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E28\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E34\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EGoodwill\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E22\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E19\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E16\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/chart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_5\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_6\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWatch items\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Applicability index in the claim system is lagging bulletin publication\\\\r\\\\n- Adjudicate from the bulletin document, not the index\\\\r\\\\n- Goodwill approvals given in channels are not being recorded against claims\\\\r\\\\n- Authority must be recorded in the claim system \\\\u2014 policy 7.1\\\\r\\\\n- Commissioning records missing for a small number of assets\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_6\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.7539183}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/02-Bulletins/TSB-C-0051 Extended coverage - 4000-series hydraulic circuit and compre.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022TSB-C-0051 Extended coverage - 4000-series hydraulic circuit and compre\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022TSB-C-0051 Extended coverage - 4000-series hydraulic circuit and compre.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/02-Bulletins/TSB-C-0051 Extended coverage - 4000-series hydraulic circuit and compre.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Technical Service Bulletin TSB-C-0051  \\\\r\\\\n_Extended coverage - 4000-series hydraulic circuit and compressor_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Bulletin reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-C-0051\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2026-01-15\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Product family**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4000-series industrial chiller\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Serial range**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCIE-4000-CH-01200 to CIE-4000-CH-01850 inclusive\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Status**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCurrent\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Purpose\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nElevated failure rates have been observed on the hydraulic circuit and compressor of affected units. Coverage is extended as set out below.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Effect on warranty\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nFor assets within the serial range named above, coverage of the hydraulic circuit and compressor is extended to 36 months from the date of commissioning, or 8,000 running hours, whichever occurs first.  \\\\r\\\\nThis bulletin names a serial range and therefore takes precedence over the regional addendum and the Global Warranty Policy, in accordance with clause 1.4 of that policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Note on the service system index\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThe applicability index held in the service claim system is maintained for reporting and may lag this document. Where the index and this bulletin disagree on the serial range, this bulletin governs, in accordance with clause 1.4 of the Global Warranty Policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Claim handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nClaims adjudicated under this bulletin are recorded against funding code TSB with the reference TSB-C-0051.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.7545189}]}]}\"}]", "LatencyMs": 4335}, {"ToolCallId": "call_Ban3gnxwO2Mzt57p3SZlu2Fv", "Title": "m365__search_enterprise_files", "Status": "Completed", "Inputs": [{"Name": "searchQuery", "Value": "C-2026-04103 Inspection Report CIE-2200-AC-00320"}, {"Name": "from", "Value": "0"}, {"Name": "size", "Value": "10"}], "Output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\u0022FileRetrievalDetails\\u0022:[{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/06-ClaimEvidence/C-2026-04188 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01366.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022C-2026-04188 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01366\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022C-2026-04188 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01366.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/06-ClaimEvidence/C-2026-04188 Inspection Report CIE-4000-CH-01366.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Field Inspection Report  \\\\r\\\\n_Claim C-2026-04188_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Claim reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u