**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCurrent\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Purpose\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nElevated failure rates have been observed on the valve plate of affected units. Coverage is extended as set out below.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Effect on warranty\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nFor assets within the serial range named above, coverage of the valve plate is extended to 30 months from the date of commissioning, or 7,000 running hours, whichever occurs first.  \\\\r\\\\nThis bulletin names a serial range and therefore takes precedence over the regional addendum and the Global Warranty Policy, in accordance with clause 1.4 of that policy.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Claim handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nClaims adjudicated under this bulletin are recorded against funding code TSB with the reference TSB-P-0112.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.7216384}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\u003Cslide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWarranty Review \\\\u2014 FY26 Q3\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial \\\\u00B7 Warranty Operations \\\\u00B7 published 16 April 2026\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EHeadlines\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Warranty cost at 3.4% of revenue, up 0.6 points \\\\u2014 driven by bulletin activity\\\\r\\\\n- TSB-C-0051 extended 4000-series hydraulic and compressor coverage in January\\\\r\\\\n- TSB-P-0112 superseded TSB-P-0107 in February, narrowing the covered range\\\\r\\\\n- FY26 labour rates took effect 1 April 2026\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECoverage position by instrument\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Instrument**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Applies to**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Period**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Notes**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nAll, unless varied\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 mo / 6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nGlobal baseline\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-IN-2.1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia installations\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n18 mo / 5,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nShorter than global\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-EM-1.3\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEMEA installati