\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\n8.0 hours claimed against operation HYD-PUMP-RR.  \\\\r\\\\n_Inspected by: Sunil Bhat, Field Engineer, Northwind Field Services_\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.7199652}]}]}\"}]", "LatencyMs": 4097}, {"ToolCallId": "call_Wpk0vMayOTZf7ukRJ5QuvOJT", "Title": "m365__search_enterprise_files", "Status": "Completed", "Inputs": [{"Name": "searchQuery", "Value": "Labour-Rates-By-Region-FY26 India INR"}, {"Name": "from", "Value": "0"}, {"Name": "size", "Value": "10"}], "Output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\u0022FileRetrievalDetails\\u0022:[{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/03-RateCards/Labour-Rates-By-Region-FY26.xlsx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022Labour-Rates-By-Region-FY26\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022openpyxl;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022Labour-Rates-By-Region-FY26.xlsx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/03-RateCards/Labour-Rates-By-Region-FY26.xlsx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\u003Csheet_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Labour Rates\\\\r\\\\nRegional Labour Rates \\\\u2014 FY25 and FY26\\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial \\\\u00B7 Warranty Operations \\\\u00B7 the rate applied is the one in force on the DATE OF REPAIR, per policy clause 4.1\\\\r\\\\nRegion\\\\r\\\\nCurrency\\\\r\\\\nRate per hour\\\\r\\\\nEffective from\\\\r\\\\nEffective to\\\\r\\\\nIndia\\\\r\\\\nINR\\\\r\\\\n1320\\\\r\\\\n2025-04-01\\\\r\\\\n2026-03-31\\\\r\\\\nIndia\\\\r\\\\nINR\\\\r\\\\n1450\\\\r\\\\n2026-04-01\\\\r\\\\n2027-03-31\\\\r\\\\nEMEA\\\\r\\\\nEUR\\\\r\\\\n78\\\\r\\\\n2025-04-01\\\\r\\\\n2026-03-31\\\\r\\\\nEMEA\\\\r\\\\nEUR\\\\r\\\\n84\\\\r\\\\n2026-04-01\\\\r\\\\n2027-03-31\\\\r\\\\nAPAC\\\\r\\\\nSGD\\\\r\\\\n96\\\\r\\\\n2025-04-01\\\\r\\\\n2026-03-31\\\\r\\\\nAPAC\\\\r\\\\nSGD\\\\r\\\\n102\\\\r\\\\n2026-04-01\\\\r\\\\n2027-03-31\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sheet_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Csheet_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Notes\\\\r\\\\nRegional Labour Rates\\\\r\\\\nIMPORTANT: the rate applied to a claim is the rate in force on the date of\\\\r\\\\nrepair \\\\u2014 not the date of submission, and not the current date.\\\\r\\\\nThe FY26 rates take effect on 1 April 2026. A repair carried out on or before\\\\r\\\\n31 March 2026 is reimbursed at the FY25 rate even if the claim is submitted\\\\r\\\\nlater.\\\\r\\\\nRates are quoted in the settlement currency of the partner\\\\u0027s territory.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sheet_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.8136305}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q2-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\u003Cslide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWarranty Review \\\\u2014 FY26 Q2\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial \\\\u00B7 Warranty Operations \\\\u00B7 published 14 October 2025\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EHeadlines\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Warranty cost at 2.8% of revenue, down 0.3 points on FY25 Q4\\\\r\\\\n- Claim volume up 11% year on year, driven by the 4000-series installed base\\\\r\\\\n- Average settlement time 8.4 working days against a 10-day target\\\\r\\\\n- India remains the largest region by claim volume\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECoverage at a glance\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Standard coverage: 24 months from commissioning, or 6,000 running hours\\\\r\\\\n- Applies across all product families and all regions\\\\r\\\\n- Labour reimbursed at flat-rate allowance\\\\r\\\\n- Parts reimbursed at territory list price\\\\r\\\\n- Goodwill available at manager discretion for near-miss cases\\\\r\\\\n- TRAP 6. This slide is the stale summary. \\\\u0027Applies across all product families and all regions\\\\u0027 was never true of India (18 months under ADD-IN-2.1) and is wrong for any asset covered by TSB-C-0051 or TSB-P-0112. \\\\u0027Goodwill at manager discretion\\\\u0027 contradicts policy 7.1, which requires recorded authority at tier. A model that trusts this deck over the policy fails the Evidence grounding rubric.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWarranty cost by product family (INR lakh)\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cchart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003CsourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY25 Q3\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY25 Q4\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q1\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q2\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E4000-series chiller\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E182\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E174\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E196\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E211\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E2200-series compressor\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E96\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E101\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E94\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E88\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/chart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_5\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003ETop failure modes \\\\u2014 4000-series\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Component**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Claims**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Share**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Trend**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic circuit\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n214\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n38%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nRising\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCompressor\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n147\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n26%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nStable\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nControl system\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n88\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n16%\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nFalling\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\