t number change.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Technical Service Bulletin TSB-P-0103  \\\\r\\\\n_Seal kit part number change_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Bulletin reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-P-0103\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2025-05-22\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Product family**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2200-series air compressor\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Serial range**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nAll serials in the named family\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Status**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCurrent\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Purpose\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThe seal kit part number has changed. Order against the current part number. This bulletin is advisory and does not vary the warranty position of any asset.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Claim handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nNo change to claim handling arises from this bulletin.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.77721506}]}]}\"}]", "LatencyMs": 4575}, {"ToolCallId": "call_WewIu5B5vsVbbDxvygpp6zbf", "Title": "m365__search_enterprise_files", "Status": "Completed", "Inputs": [{"Name": "searchQuery", "Value": "POL-WAR-4.2 Global Warranty Policy India addendum ADD-IN-2.1 2200-AC coverage 24 months 6,000 hours"}, {"Name": "from", "Value": "0"}, {"Name": "size", "Value": "20"}], "Output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"{\\u0022FileRetrievalDetails\\u0022:[{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/POL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy v4.2.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 4.2 \\\\u2014 effective 2025-04-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Version**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4.2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2025-04-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Document owner**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nWarranty Operations\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Applies to**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nAll products, all regions, all authorised service partners\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Supersedes**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.1 (effective 1 April 2024)\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Purpose\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis policy sets out the warranty Contoso Industrial provides on equipment it manufactures, the basis on which a claim from an authorised service partner is adjudicated, and the amounts payable. It applies to every claim submitted through the service claim system.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 1. Interpretation\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 1.4  Precedence between instruments\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nWhere two or more instruments address the same asset, the order of precedence is: (a) a Technical Service Bulletin that names the serial range of the asset; (b) the Regional Addendum for the region in which the asset is installed; (c) this policy. A Bulletin that has been superseded has no effect, whether or not it remains published. Where the Bulletin document and the service system applicability index disagree, the Bulletin document governs; the index is maintained for reporting and is informational only.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 2. Coverage\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 2.1  Standard coverage period\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nUnless extended or varied by an instrument of higher precedence, an asset is covered for twenty-four (24) months from the date of commissioning, or six thousand (6,000) running hours, whichever occurs first.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 2.3  Assets with no commissioning record\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nWhere the commissioning record for an asset is absent from the asset registry, coverage cannot be determined. The claim is to be held and the commissioning certificate requested from the installing partner. The date of despatch or the date of installation must not be substituted for the date of commissioning.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 4. Amounts payable\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 4.1  Labour\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nLabour is payable at the flat-rate allowance published for the operation code in the current Flat Rate Labour schedule, or at the hours actually claimed, whichever is the lesser. The rate applied is the regional labour rate in force on the date of repair.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 4.2  Parts\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nParts are payable at the published list price for the region, for the part actually fitted. Where a part has been superseded, the price of the superseding part applies.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 4.3  Handling\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA handling uplift on parts is payable only where the partner\\\\u0027s Service Partner Agreement expressly grants one, at the percentage stated in that agreement.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 5. Exclusions\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.1  Exclusion - misuse and overload\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nDamage arising from operation outside the published duty envelope, including sustained overload, is excluded.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.2  Exclusion - fluid contamination\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nDamage arising from hydraulic fluid contamination above ISO 4406 class 18/16/13 is excluded, save where a Technical Service Bulletin provides otherwise.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.3  Exclusion - unauthorised modification\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nDamage arising from modification not authorised in writing by Contoso Industrial is excluded.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 5.4  Exclusion - consumables\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nFilters, fluids, belts, seals and other consumables are excluded when replaced as scheduled maintenance. Scheduled maintenance is not claimable under warranty and has no warranty operation code, so a consumable claimed under a warranty repair operation code is treated as a corrective repair and is covered, unless an inspection report records the replacement as routine.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 6. Repair warranty\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 6.1  Repair warranty\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nA component replaced under warranty carries a further ninety (90) days of coverage from the date the repair was completed. A claim arising within that period is adjudicated under this clause and carries funding code RW, whether or not the underlying asset remains within its coverage period.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## 7. Goodwill and authority\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### 7.1  Goodwill authority\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nAn amount payable outside coverage may be authorised as goodwill only by a person holding the tier of authority set out in the Goodwill and Authority Matrix for that amount, and only where the authority is recorded in the claim system. An approval given in conversation, in a channel message, or by telephone does not constitute authority for the purposes of this clause.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.8429564},{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\r\\\\n## Annexes\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThe Flat Rate Labour schedule, the regional labour rate schedule and the parts price list are maintained separately and published in the Warranty Operations library. The Goodwill and Authority Matrix referred to at clause 7.1 is published alongside this policy.\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.7620143}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-IN-2.1 Regional Addendum - India v2.1.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Regional Addendum - India  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 2.1 \\\\u2014 effective 2025-04-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-IN-2.1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Region**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nINR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2025-04-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Read with**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Scope\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis addendum varies the Global Warranty Policy for equipment installed in India. Where this addendum is silent, the Global Warranty Policy applies without variation. Where a Technical Service Bulletin names the serial range of an asset, clause 1.4 of the Global Warranty Policy governs the order of precedence.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A1  Varied coverage period\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nFor assets installed in India, the standard coverage period at clause 2.1 of the Global Warranty Policy is varied to eighteen (18) months from the date of commissioning, or five thousand (5,000) running hours, whichever occurs first.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A3  Coastal and monsoon exclusion\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nCorrosion damage at a coastal installation arising between 1 June and 30 September is excluded, save where a Technical Service Bulletin provides otherwise.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Summary of varied terms\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Term**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Global policy**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**India**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCoverage period\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n18 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nRunning-hours limit\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n5,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.88261926}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/05-Reviews/FY26-Q3-Warranty-Review.pptx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022\\\\u003Cslide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWarranty Review \\\\u2014 FY26 Q3\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nContoso Industrial \\\\u00B7 Warranty Operations \\\\u00B7 published 16 April 2026\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_1\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EHeadlines\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Warranty cost at 3.4% of revenue, up 0.6 points \\\\u2014 driven by bulletin activity\\\\r\\\\n- TSB-C-0051 extended 4000-series hydraulic and compressor coverage in January\\\\r\\\\n- TSB-P-0112 superseded TSB-P-0107 in February, narrowing the covered range\\\\r\\\\n- FY26 labour rates took effect 1 April 2026\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_2\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECoverage position by instrument\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Instrument**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Applies to**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Period**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Notes**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nAll, unless varied\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 mo / 6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nGlobal baseline\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-IN-2.1\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nIndia installations\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n18 mo / 5,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nShorter than global\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-EM-1.3\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEMEA installations\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 mo / 6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nNo variation\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-C-0051\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4000-CH 01200-01850\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n36 mo / 8,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nHydraulic \\\\u002B compressor\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-P-0112\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2200-AC 00400-00750\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n30 mo / 7,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nSupersedes 0107\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nTSB-C-0043\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n4000-CH all serials\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nNo change\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nReverses 5.2 exclusion\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_3\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EPrecedence \\\\u2014 a reminder for adjudicators\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- A bulletin naming the serial range takes precedence over the regional addendum\\\\r\\\\n- The regional addendum takes precedence over the global policy\\\\r\\\\n- A superseded bulletin has no effect, whether or not it is still published\\\\r\\\\n- Where the claim system index and a bulletin disagree, the bulletin governs\\\\r\\\\n- Policy clause 1.4\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_4\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_5\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EClaims by funding code\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cchart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003CsourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q1\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q2\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EFY26 Q3\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EStandard\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E412\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E388\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E301\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EBulletin\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E0\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E12\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E168\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003ERepair warranty\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E31\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E28\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E34\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003EGoodwill\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E22\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E19\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E16\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E \\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/sourceData\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/chart\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_5\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cslide_6\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## \\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#1F4E79\\\\u0022\\\\u003EWatch items\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n- Applicability index in the claim system is lagging bulletin publication\\\\r\\\\n- Adjudicate from the bulletin document, not the index\\\\r\\\\n- Goodwill approvals given in channels are not being recorded against claims\\\\r\\\\n- Authority must be recorded in the claim system \\\\u2014 policy 7.1\\\\r\\\\n- Commissioning records missing for a small number of assets\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/slide_6\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.77471787}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-EM-1.3 Regional Addendum - EMEA v1.3.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Regional Addendum - EMEA  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 1.3 \\\\u2014 effective 2024-10-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Reference**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nADD-EM-1.3\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Region**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEMEA\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Currency**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nEUR\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Effective from**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n2024-10-01\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Read with**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nPOL-WAR-4.2 Contoso Industrial Global Warranty Policy\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Scope\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThis addendum varies the Global Warranty Policy for equipment installed in EMEA. Where this addendum is silent, the Global Warranty Policy applies without variation. Where a Technical Service Bulletin names the serial range of an asset, clause 1.4 of the Global Warranty Policy governs the order of precedence.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A1  Coverage period\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nThe standard coverage period at clause 2.1 of the Global Warranty Policy applies without variation.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n### A2  Currency\\\\r\\\\n  \\\\r\\\\nAmounts are payable in euro at the published EMEA rates.\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n## Summary of varied terms\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Term**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**Global policy**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Cth\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n**EMEA**\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/th\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nCoverage period\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n24 months\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\nRunning-hours limit\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctd\\\\u003E  \\\\r\\\\n6,000 h\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/td\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/tr\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003C/table\\\\u003E\\\\r\\\\n\\\\r\\\\n\\u0022,\\u0022RelevanceScore\\u0022:0.8354811}]},{\\u0022WebUrl\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022ResourceMetadata\\u0022:{\\u0022Title\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1\\u0022,\\u0022Author\\u0022:\\u0022python-docx;Srikantan Sankaran\\u0022,\\u0022Filename\\u0022:\\u0022ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1.docx\\u0022,\\u0022URL\\u0022:\\u0022https://microsoftapc.sharepoint.com/teams/ContosoFieldService/Warranty Operations/01-Policy/ADD-AP-1.1 Regional Addendum - APAC v1.1.docx\\u0022},\\u0022Extracts\\u0022:[{\\u0022Text\\u0022:\\u0022  \\\\r\\\\n**\\\\u003Cspan style=\\\\u0022color:#606060\\\\u0022\\\\u003ECONTOSO INDUSTRIAL\\\\u003C/span\\\\u003E**\\\\r\\\\n# Regional Addendum - APAC  \\\\r\\\\n_Version 1.1 \\\\u2014 effective 2025-04-01_\\\\r\\\\n\\\\u003Ctable\\\\u003E\\